      "text": "Let us make man in our image, Gen. 1:26 (Moses 2:26–27). Lord … hast made heaven and earth, 2 Kgs. 19:15 (Acts 14:15; Mosiah 4:2; 3 Ne. 9:15; D&C 14:9). Thine hands have made me, Job 10:8. when I laid the foundations of the earth, Job 38:4. By the word of the Lord were the heavens made, Ps. 33:6. Lord, the Creator of the ends of the earth, Isa. 40:28. Holy One of Israel hath created it, Isa. 41:20. Lord, he that created the heavens, Isa. 42:5 (45:18). redeemer … that maketh all things, Isa. 44:24. I have made the earth, and created man upon it, Isa. 45:12 (1 Ne. 17:36). I create new heavens and a new earth, Isa. 65:17. He hath made the earth by his power, Jer. 51:15. he that formeth the mountains, Amos 4:13.",
